# Files that must NEVER be bundled into a shinyapps.io deployment.
# rsconnect does NOT read .gitignore for this -- it has its own hardcoded
# exclusion list plus whatever is listed here. Added 2026-09-02 alongside the
# dev/staging S3 bucket split: .Renviron.local carries LOCAL-ONLY AWS
# overrides (a separate dev bucket) and must never reach production, since a
# deploy picking it up would point shinyapps.io itself at the dev bucket.
.Renviron.local

# Added 2026-09-26. Everything below was being bundled into production.
#
# .RData is a saved R workspace (513 KB, last written 2026-02-19). R loads a
# .RData sitting in the working directory automatically at startup, so a
# months-old workspace was being restored into production's global
# environment on every boot -- stale objects silently shadowing live ones.
.RData
.Rhistory
.Rproj.user

# wipe_scripts/ DELETE PRODUCTION DATA. They are kept in the repo on purpose
# (they are real operational tools and stay under version control, recoverable
# from git at any time) -- they simply have no business being shipped inside
# the running app, where nothing needs them and anything reachable is a risk.
wipe_scripts

# Test suite: ~100 files, never executed in production. Two of them
# (tests/_run_saas.R, tests/_run_agenda.R) monkey-patch aws.s3 with in-memory
# mocks, which is exactly what must never be loadable next to live data.
tests
